# Scoring Scheme
# Self    <->   Self    : 10
# Tiny    <->   Tiny    : 5
# Tiny    <->  Small    : 2
# Tiny    <->  Large    : -5
# Small   <->  Small    : 5
# Small   <->  Large    : -2
# Large   <->  Large    : 5
#
# It's based upon a simple assumption that same group can be
# acceptably substituted but substitution between tiny(small) and
# large groups are generally unfavorable. 
